# DC Scan UI (the-dump-bin)

- **Canonical dashboard:** `dc-scan/index.html` at `https://the-dump-bin.com/dc-scan/`
- Auth via `auth-gate.js` + Dump Bin magic link; API on `eod-api.the-dump-bin.com`.
- **Resync SAS PROD** calls `POST /api/dc-scan/resync` and updates snapshot in place — no `location.reload()`.
- Release/swap: `decide.html` with `type=dcscan`.
- Full skill: `.cursor/skills/dc-scan-volunteer-board/SKILL.md`

Push **the-dump-bin** for UI changes; push **eod-api** for API/PROD sync changes.
